    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91044294c228b4622173e250",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ついに、ナリタトップロードのデビュー戦。\nプレッシャーに押しつぶされそうになる\n彼女の前に、クラスメイトたちが現れた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5174f67dee5814720574dac53912718d1c8ebfdbe64d77989d7ddce83cbc86d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68a2ae2ae33510309dd277a7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "モノローグ",
      "source_fingerprint": "143e706e67b179bcda182d47e6a727910bb5778ac01a05356150554568138628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b0dfec27da6fd909c2b0390",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "みんなからの励ましの声に応えるように\nナリタトップロードは気合いを入れ直す。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a9c5bd318f1d78dcbeaa22e631aef8ff66da1c7080cfd395799786360082ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:292f7045c24833f6e6a41b1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "モノローグ",
      "source_fingerprint": "143e706e67b179bcda182d47e6a727910bb5778ac01a05356150554568138628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba2368e66deae6f78f705abd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『私――絶対、期待に応えてみせますっ』\nナリタトップロードのデビュー戦が、\nいま始まる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "496c4cc8fcca8b1fd06fdad6b0a2d56b6a7f685137beefecf70d8cf5e4eceb3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2bb7c9a1bab8752d0a25062",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "デビュー戦にむけて",
      "source_fingerprint": "c88c627d5fad2a0656ad0aaeb8c014e4b43e87a2a69d71976076b9249b092434",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a393bfb686981bf0074dc3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "モノローグ",
      "source_fingerprint": "143e706e67b179bcda182d47e6a727910bb5778ac01a05356150554568138628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fc8632bf6acb9a00dd1e203",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同期の宿敵として――そして憧れとして\nナリタトップロードがずっと追い続けてきた\n相手であるアドマイヤベガ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6243c919702e5985bfc5819367633f45c5f725d52f0b07d422eaff741b449172",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3253d401195afb577c90522e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "モノローグ",
      "source_fingerprint": "143e706e67b179bcda182d47e6a727910bb5778ac01a05356150554568138628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4435ae941d5bf01def7727e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "そんな彼女との待望の初戦。勝利を望む\nナリタトップロードだったが、『弥生賞』は\nクラシック三冠の初戦『皐月賞』の前哨戦だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a86800270baf9610ad7d8909e9f0f657ca20109e820ce43d57d9a0905db0b110",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5e6d1ae3b6bff9961347b51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "モノローグ",
      "source_fingerprint": "143e706e67b179bcda182d47e6a727910bb5778ac01a05356150554568138628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cce7e4e906b61674cd89b916",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "まずは、相手の実力を確かめる。\nアドマイヤベガという憧れが、\nどれだけ彼方にある星なのか――",
      "source_fingerprint": "284ecd53fa4521fac0b3af09f064ee0d7e9f93cd86372dd8902e40922945f49a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fcccc7ef36f740940897621",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "モノローグ",
      "source_fingerprint": "143e706e67b179bcda182d47e6a727910bb5778ac01a05356150554568138628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d523485f13bf54d3028f0d75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "積み上げてきたものを全てぶつけるため、\nナリタトップロードは、『弥生賞』を走る！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bbe0089c3c2cf603e29ced358d1804f4c32a9018a445453d66351219e8697f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8163af5ca249207bd7bdcb7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "弥生賞にむけて",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4e6b36c2380bcff68b09357c2de99016bfa6ed7b241ca06ef949cf0a2796b7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd2f3560f77da482e8ae8101",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『皐月賞』、当日の天候は……雨。\n道悪が苦手なナリタトップロードに\nとって、それは大きな試練だった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff49645d00413ab336bdbf4cad933f336e254a63a3d0cb0e25f18c40cab1f9c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffbd9b34cbe5bef8a08c13a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "しかし、試練を抱えるのは、他のウマ娘も\n同様で――アドマイヤベガは食欲が減退し、\n体調が万全ではない様子だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "826ea481b218964812f04f3a8d1242eb70557f75dd823e2d6eac65836f30ab0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f610d68385d773417828695",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "そんな2人の前に、テイエムオペラオーが\n現れる。道化を演じているように見えるが――\nそれは本性だろうか、それとも……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0234a03574a0460e3c250c9f2c23a4a6b95f66b58955a32db8ecf8f5b4cc6fe2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:632871bab58b54e9e583155a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "誰もがハンデを背負う中、クラシック三冠\n第1戦――『皐月賞』が始まる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f91dcfc5cb161f1a6b9a44bd2ce9d78a1bb487ea60a57d3fc372e7c6bab5764",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1717781a462cf1651940ca2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皐月賞にむけて",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4f5038066ada68daa0fc7f9b8fe22ccc944240207cb91beb09e4a00ad363696",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
