    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5e6c3d57271000420c6db1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "彼女は公言する。全力で走れば、\nすべての人に輝きを届けられる――\nそんなウマ娘になれると。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ed9ac4a5770a368dd18f3fd896885fabf614e4396e06367c674be52efe8acb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4dd07860da42d712f7a941f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "モノローグ",
      "source_fingerprint": "143e706e67b179bcda182d47e6a727910bb5778ac01a05356150554568138628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db963fe0a4d45498cd1ca019",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "そして輝きを届ける相手にアドマイヤベガも\n含まれていた。勝つためにすべてを\n投げ捨てようとする彼女を、変えたかった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c7fdef7a98bd00eca3f78c95d8df11d28f40e1d0f22c631559bd83a9d960d35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
